==Battleground==
*5 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gabriel]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Unlike the previous stages, the Gories here can seriously pose a threat, so leveling your Cats up with [[Catseye]]s will obviously help a lot.

